    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mullery O’Gara are pleased to present 63 Idrone Drive, Knocklyon to the open market. An attractive and mature semi-detached home, extended to side and rear with c. 1528 Sq.Ft / 142 Sq.M living space.\r\n\r\nCarefully maintained throughout with ample parking to front, rear garden and patio area with concrete built outbuilding and side access. Excellent layout and full of natural light. Comprising hall, lounge with opening to family room and opening to living area. There is a large extended open plan kitchen/dining/living with patio doors to garden. Upstairs are 4 bedrooms and family bathroom. \r\n\r\nOutside is parking for a number of cars and walled rear garden and side access.\r\n\r\n\r\nSituated in this much sought after location beside a wide variety of schools, Knocklyon shopping centre, sports facilities, bus routes, parks and the M50."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall\r\nTiled floor.\r\n\r\nLounge\r\nMarble mantlepiece with solid fuel stove. Tiled floor.\r\n\r\nFamily room\r\n\r\nKitchen\r\nRange of wall and floor units, sink unit. Part-tiled. Tiled floor. Plumbed for dishwasher. Opening\r\nto:\r\n\r\nDining\r\nVelux windows. Breakfast bar. Door to side. Bay window. Tiled floor.\r\n\r\nLiving\r\nVelux window. Patio door to rear. Tiled floor.\r\n\r\nUpstairs\r\nBedroom 1 (Rear)\r\nFitted wardrobe. Glazed timber floor.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (Front)\r\nFitted wardrobe. Stained timber floor.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 (Front)\r\nFitted wardrobe.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 (Side)\r\nFitted shelved units.\r\n\r\nShowerroom\r\nTwin shower, w.c., whb. Tiled. Towel radiator.\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\nBath, shower, w.c.,whb on medicine cupboard. Towel radiator. Tiled. Vanity mirror.\r\n\r\nOutside\r\nParking to front\r\nWalled garden and patio areas\r\nOutbuilding\r\nSide access"
      },
      {
